### Logical Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G3, G4, G5 [AND]**: Both delivering food and retrieving dishes are required.
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2 [OR]**: Either method of delivery is acceptable.
- **G4 -> G4.1, G4.2, G4.3 [OR]**: Multiple dish retrieval methods.
- **G5 -> G5.1, G5.2, G5.3 [OR]**: Various door-opening methods.

This model ensures that all aspects of the mission are covered, with clear decompositions and execution strategies.
